  "body": "Tucked away in the peaceful hills above Orewa, this exceptional 1,457sqm section offers a rare blend of privacy, natural beauty, and sweeping views. Unlike many sections on the market, this one comes fully equipped - with all key utilities already connected, including the all-important wastewater service.\r\n\r\nBeyond the secure, automated gate lies a private retreat framed by mature, covenanted native bush alive with birdlife. Soak in stunning sunsets and water views across the Orewa Estuary to Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nAlongside power, water, gas and wastewater, significant groundwork has been completed - featuring a concreted driveway and retaining walls. Included are a 2022 Resource Consent (valid to June 2027) and previously consented plans for a high-spec 258sqm executive four-bedroom home - giving you a strong head start or freedom to bring your own design.\r\n\r\nA rare find - peaceful, private and build-ready in town, whilst feeling like you are still in the country - just minutes from beaches, schools, cafés and the motorway.\r\n\r\nContact John today to arrange your viewing.",
